cision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","source_order":[15,301,743],"order":3372}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0035","name":"李孚","evidence":["liusima-q-4e4e9578692fd04fae52","liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e","liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","liusima-q-04d06b0e182d989ad8a7","liusima-q-90a2719401ac7fe0a8a8","liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319","liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173","liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","liusima-q-85795a83c0ae99eddb9d","liusima-q2-b7e2fc6eed28bd7dba17"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-74c663fbd0d6305aea07","text":"《魏略》记初为袁尚主簿；后自冗散为解长，稍迁司隶校尉、阳平太守；本姓冯。","evidence":["liusima-q2-b7e2fc6eed28bd7dba17"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-3dd3a1390375a0b1eaee","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-546398c9e99f491661e8","layer":"original","quote":"良死后，进围邺城","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":115,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"遂历太祖营前，径南过；从南围角西折，当章门；复责怒守围者，收缚之。因开其围，驰到城下，呼城上人；城上人以绳引，孚得入","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":378,"end":436,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-04d06b0e182d989ad8a7","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"又使人人持火，孚乃无何将本所从，作降人服，随辈夜出。时守围将士，闻城中悉降，火光照曜。但共观火，不复视围。孚出北门，遂从西北角突围得去","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":570,"end":637,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-19525e01c7a44ab9fb39","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚事讫，欲得还，而顾外围必急，不可复冒。谓己使命当速反，乃阴心计，请配曰：‘今城中谷少，无用老弱为也；不如驱出之以省谷也。’配从其计，乃复夜简别得数千人，皆使持白幡，从三门并出降","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":480,"end":569,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-23a8bca18ba745f73173","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"会尚不能救邺，破走至中山，而袁谭又追击尚。尚走，孚与尚相失，遂诣谭；复为谭主簿","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":672,"end":711,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-3bfc0caffb077cfb3920","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚权宜欲得见太祖，乃骑诣牙门，称：‘冀州主簿李孚欲口白密事。’太祖见之，孚叩头谢","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":743,"end":783,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-44f3b0417da045c5c319","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚比见尚，尚甚欢喜","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.x